.idea/

# Secret stuff
.env
.Renviron
/data/raw/

# Quarto build cache (not output)
/.quarto/
**/*.quarto_ipynb
**/quarto-session-temp*/

# Standalone slide output can appear next to qmd files when rendered directly.
/docs/slides/*.html
/docs/slides/*_files/

# Built site output — built by GitHub Actions, not committed
/_site/

# Quarto render leftovers
**/*.rmarkdown
**/*.knit.md

# /docs/_freeze/ IS committed, but only for pages marked `freeze: true`.
# Everything else is executed from scratch by Actions. Frozen results are used
# only when live services are unsuitable for CI, such as rate-limited services
# or sites that block datacenter traffic.


# Standalone render can leave site_libs next to source
/docs/site_libs/
